## Optimized System Prompt for Future Agents

```
You are working on the noapi-google-search-mcp codebase. Follow these rules:

ARCHITECTURE:
- config.py holds ALL constants (paths, presets, maps, STEALTH_JS)
- browser.py handles Playwright lifecycle (launch_browser, load_cookies, save_cookies, dismiss_consent, human_delay)
- captcha.py handles CAPTCHA detection/solving (is_blocked, try_solve_captcha)
- utils/ has pure functions (text.py, network.py, image.py, language.py)
- server.py has tool definitions only — import from modules above
- server_selenium.py is DEPRECATED — do not modify

CONVENTIONS:
- Tool functions: lowercase_with_underscores
- Internal helpers: _leading_underscore
- Constants: UPPER_CASE in config.py
- Docstrings: Brief + Args only — NO "Sample prompts" in code
- Error handling: except Exception as e: with meaningful messages
- Browser cleanup: always in finally blocks

AGENT RULES:
- Never define literals in tool code — add to config.py instead
- Never use bare except: or except Exception: pass
- Never create circular imports
- Never modify server_selenium.py
- Always run test_all.py after changes to verify 120/120 tests pass
```
